        "content": "## Proposal follow-up chaser (sends a nudge after 3 and 7 days)\nLooks at your proposals sheet and emails a friendly nudge when a proposal has had no answer for 3 days, and a last note after 7.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "309d4447-f587-55fc-b90e-2fea9d0cd57d",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
